<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Unholy Shout</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 4
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 120), Necromancer (guild level 160)
Mana: 40
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast unholy shout &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast unholy shout</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The strongest of the prayers to the dark forces against the good: the 
caster shouts to evil and grasps the target. Any target whose alignment 
is above neutral can be struck, and is hurt hard; the truly good are hurt harder still; on the evil and the 
neutral, nothing happens. The better your divine power and sphere, the 
more it hurts. It does about as well against any armour, and since the 
caster grasps the target, a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
